From df244fc77dc48d60ea195847d51182901722fc40 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ChibiButo <chibibuto@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:08:02 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] qualcommbe: add TP-Link Archer BE550 v1 / BE9300 v1 (2.4 GHz
 test build)

Port of mrnuke's WIP BE550 DTS to current qualcommbe bindings, cross-checked
against the board DTS in TP-Link's BE9300 v1 GPL release. Enables wired
ports (QCA8084 10G-QXGMII + QCA8081 WAN), SPI-NAND, and the integrated
2.4 GHz radio via ath11k + secure WCSS. Adds the ath11k IPQ9574
max_tx_ring fix. Initramfs only. Untested on hardware.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QBAbzruGbqeCrWZpRemErb
